nanovllm/layers/rotary_embedding.py
     6→def apply_rotary_emb(
     7→    x: torch.Tensor,
     8→    cos: torch.Tensor,
     9→    sin: torch.Tensor,
    10→) -> torch.Tensor:
    11→    x1, x2 = torch.chunk(x.float(), 2, dim=-1)
    12→    y1 = x1 * cos - x2 * sin
    13→    y2 = x2 * cos + x1 * sin
    14→    return torch.cat((y1, y2), dim=-1).to(x.dtype)
    17→class RotaryEmbedding …
